WEBVTT

00:02:03.060 --> 00:02:06.470
Ward away the obscene,
accursed oni,

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:09.800
and upon our benevolent lord, the
nobility, and the officialdom,

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:13.310
and to all who preside over this land,

00:02:13.310 --> 00:02:16.440
let eternal prosperity be promised.

00:02:50.280 --> 00:02:54.080
As the decree prescribes, the
Imperial wish shall be met.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:12.420
I've been told the Watanabe faction
will reach the capital by tomorrow.

00:03:13.900 --> 00:03:17.040
Only the gods can know how
this battle might end.

00:03:17.040 --> 00:03:18.510
Are you saying...

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:20.340
Do not worry, my dear man.

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.710
As captain of the royal guards,

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.770
I shall willingly lay down my life
to safeguard the Court.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.860
From here, I will go alone.

00:03:51.840 --> 00:03:54.510
I will only be accompanied
by our sacred vehicles.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:57.750
Alone, Sire? That's too dangerous!

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:59.950
Do not worry, I do not intend to fight.

00:03:59.950 --> 00:04:02.550
I only intend to answer
the Emperor's edict

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.390
as dictated by Watanabe's
ancient ways.

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:06.790
But, Sire...

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:12.320
Do not worry. Set up camp
and let the men rest!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:15.190
Forward!

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.080
Dread...

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:05.550
Suffering...

00:05:06.510 --> 00:05:07.980
They come!

00:05:12.890 --> 00:05:14.590
Oni gods at the Razyomon!

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:17.180
Oni gods? What do you
mean oni gods?

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.160
What is that?

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.430
Oni gods! Monster deities!

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:47.880
I've come summoned before the Court
by the edict. Let me pass!

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:53.390
Or are you intent on pushing
us back no matter what?

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:57.100
How dare you speak to
his lordship that way!

00:06:02.870 --> 00:06:06.700
Why must the Watanabe faction,
faithful guardians of the Court,

00:06:07.310 --> 00:06:10.440
march toward the throne with
oni gods at his side?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:12.910
Is this a rebellion?!

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:14.380
Rebellion?

00:06:15.380 --> 00:06:18.950
The kugai are divine vehicles, and we
haven't always served the Court.

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:22.590
We stood by the Court as priests of
war, helping to forge this nation.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:26.320
How can we be criticized for having
our shrines accompany us?

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:32.230
Tell this to the Emperor!

00:06:32.230 --> 00:06:35.440
If you break our vow and take our
kugai, the vessels for our gods,

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.700
then the Watanabe will be left no
choice but to resort to force!

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:08.100
We must lure those oni gods
to the land of epiphany.

00:07:25.550 --> 00:07:28.280
Behold the capital that
stands around you.

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:32.920
The plague, measles...

00:07:33.660 --> 00:07:36.930
This is the true nature of the capital
governed by the Emperor.

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:42.970
Even now, the Court is full of oni
seeking to expand their power.

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:47.510
Your cause to fight rests upon more
than the pride of a warrior clan.

00:07:47.510 --> 00:07:52.310
We're after the corruption that
threatens this entire nation!

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:02.360
There are those in the Imperial Palace

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:07.590
proclaiming the Watanabe faction to
be the wind from the northwest.

00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:11.460
The plague gods arisen from the
netherworld, or so they say?

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:17.200
The army of the Watanabe most likely

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.240
will attack the Palace
sometime tonight.

00:08:20.240 --> 00:08:21.380
Tonight?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:21.740
Tonight?
They made their appearance
this morning

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:23.280
They made their appearance
this morning

00:08:23.280 --> 00:08:25.750
to strike fear in the hearts
of those in the Palace.

00:08:29.980 --> 00:08:32.390
All the more reason for them
to attack us tonight.

00:08:32.390 --> 00:08:36.160
They'll use the cover of night,
which is ruled by the shadows,

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:38.620
coming like the gods of pestilence.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.300
Can we stop them?

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.890
This wind of plague gods?

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.430
All is in good hands, dear Empress.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.380
Lord Tsuna!

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.550
You said before

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:10.190
that we wage this war to ensure that
our ways can be preserved.

00:09:10.190 --> 00:09:12.680
Can I believe those words?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.570
Yes!

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.470
If such are your true intentions,

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:25.140
then I shall willingly serve
beneath you.

00:09:25.140 --> 00:09:26.770
However...

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:29.140
If your challenge against the court

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.370
is founded upon desire to satisfy
exorbitant ambitions...

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.680
Then you will refuse to take part?

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:38.420
Exorbitant ambitions?
Tempting indeed.

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:44.010
If it could be done, why
not usurp the throne?

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:49.060
But the most we can do today

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.520
is to have our kugai remind the
Emperor of our strength.

00:09:53.670 --> 00:09:58.170
Robbed of the Gasaraki ceremony, we
cannot achieve anything more.

00:09:58.170 --> 00:10:01.510
Do you wish for us to reclaim the
ceremony of the Gasaraki?

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:06.810
The story of the Kugutsu tells

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:09.980
that the Gasaraki appears
accompanied by a firestorm.

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:12.150
Rows of vassals are ruined
by the Gasaraki,

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:15.920
and the summoning kai is
made to be an offering,

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.860
sacrificing his life to the Gasaraki.

00:10:18.860 --> 00:10:22.430
That's why the ceremony of the
Gasaraki was abandoned,

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.900
or so you claim.

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:33.110
But I see it otherwise!

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.770
The ancient tales also say this.

00:10:38.350 --> 00:10:42.080
A kai able to vanquish the Gasaraki
will appear one day.

00:10:42.080 --> 00:10:46.290
This kai, thwarting the flames and
lightning, gives birth to a kugai.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.490
The powerful kai survives.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.620
That is the true way of the kai!

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.630
Who is to say Yushiro is not
the supreme kai?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:09.510
Were those hapless souls

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:12.710
resigned to their pitiful demise
as being their fate?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.940
You refer to those who perished
along the roads in the capital.

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:20.080
Overwhelmed by plague, the measles.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:23.320
Unable to resist its death grip.

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:25.820
Ever drenched in sorrow.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.100
The Toribeno Grave?

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:41.970
The only threat among the Watanabe
army is their oni god.

00:11:42.610 --> 00:11:44.650
In all the capital,

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:48.280
the Hallowed Grounds, the land
of the Threshold to the abyss,

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:50.020
the Toribeno Grave,

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:53.690
there is the only place to stand your
ground against the oni gods.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:57.090
And rely upon the spiritual power
of its name to defeat them?

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.750
We must place our trust in
fate there, you say?

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:02.160
It is also a land

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:05.690
no nobles will complain about even
if it is ravaged by strife.

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:07.570
In fact, they may even commend you

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:13.370
for the lowlife of Kiyomizaka have
given them no end of trouble.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:18.780
I shall risk this body and soul so
that we may be victorious.

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.940
But I do this for the sake of the
Court and nothing more!

00:12:24.850 --> 00:12:26.910
That's a pity.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:32.830
For the Toribeno Grave is
the land of epiphany,

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.620
where the Nada answers
to those who call.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:40.920
When the kugai stands, many fall
to the blade it brandishes.

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:44.130
If that is all part of the ceremony of
war, then we are no different

00:12:44.770 --> 00:12:46.370
from the plague gods

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:49.540
that robbed the lives of those
resting along the road.

00:12:51.310 --> 00:12:54.540
Even so, I must follow!

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:57.880
For that is the fate that has
been laid upon me.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.350
Fate?

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:01.550
It's a disheartening fate.

00:13:02.490 --> 00:13:03.460
Disheartening?

00:13:04.090 --> 00:13:06.890
Disheartening to be an
accursed pestilence,

00:13:07.830 --> 00:13:10.960
to be fated to sow destruction and
death by our ancient code.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.570
Is this the only path that awaits us?

00:13:17.370 --> 00:13:21.710
No, time is not unchanging.
Fate is not carved in stone.

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.650
Such are the words I am made to hear.

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:28.270
From within this soul of mine,
over and over.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:31.210
I do not know from when.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:35.680
I gather the voice has been calling out
to me across the years.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:38.750
I am not sure,

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.860
but no matter.

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.160
For I am not alone any longer.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.270
I have always been alone.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:51.700
I was always alone looking
to my older brother.

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:54.730
Then one day it dawned upon me.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:59.280
All that I've been looking upon
was my older brother's back.

00:14:00.780 --> 00:14:03.270
Absolute destitution greeted me then.

00:14:04.020 --> 00:14:06.610
Since then, I devoted myself to
the kai nature within me.

00:14:07.690 --> 00:14:09.280
To myself alone.

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:14.790
Even if the battle tonight seals my
fate as a pestilence upon others,

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.030
there is bliss in my servitude,

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:21.230
for I know I am not alone.

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:25.960
A bliss envelops me as I know our
lives overlapped in this life.

00:14:26.840 --> 00:14:29.780
This bliss envelops me in rapture!

00:14:38.050 --> 00:14:39.520
They come!

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:44.760
We depart!

00:14:52.630 --> 00:14:54.100
Onward, men!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.520
Raikou...

00:15:27.970 --> 00:15:29.990
Pull back!

00:15:32.670 --> 00:15:34.740
We are the chieftains of war!

00:15:34.740 --> 00:15:36.540
Behold as we return to claim
our former presence!

00:16:17.920 --> 00:16:21.020
They are trying to lure us
away from the Palace?

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.190
So be it!

00:16:22.190 --> 00:16:24.780
Your destruction shall accompany
the obliteration of Kyoto!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:30.760
Split into four parties as planned
before, and set the city ablaze!

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.450
And so you enter into my grasp!

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.020
That damned Watanabe faction!
They set the capital on fire!

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:15.140
Guided by the hatred raging
within the mediums,

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:17.900
let the oni god descend
upon this land.

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:20.630
Appear before me, true terror!

00:18:53.810 --> 00:18:56.210
This is it!

00:18:56.210 --> 00:18:58.270
The terror descends!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.030
The firestorm of the Gasaraki.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.770
The divine inferno that once laid
four hundred vessels to waste

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:30.830
in a flash at the Battle of Salsu River.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:36.510
Guided by the flames, the true
terror descends upon us!

00:19:54.900 --> 00:19:56.670
Perished...

00:19:56.670 --> 00:20:00.570
All too many perished,
enveloped in flames.

00:20:00.570 --> 00:20:01.980
No!

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.710
This must not go on any longer!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.250
What are you doing?

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:16.520
Countless lives will be lost.
This must be stopped.

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:22.150
I cannot let the killings
go on any longer!

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.330
Nada!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.950
You are the one.

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.990
Why? Why do you stop?!

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.270
Continue!

00:21:00.270 --> 00:21:03.360
Summon! Summon the Gasaraki
to descend before us.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.970
Recall your hatred!

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.510
Noble Yushiro!

00:21:13.450 --> 00:21:15.570
You'll die if you cast aside
your duties as kai!

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:24.890
Big Brother...

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:29.700
The summoning is broken.

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:35.370
Nothing more will be gained
from further strife!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:38.400
Our cause to fight is lost.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.870
Retreat!

00:21:53.650 --> 00:21:57.320
A millennium ago, seeking a new life,

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:02.130
we cast aside the kugai and left
the land of milk and honey.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:04.900
But it had to be done.

00:22:04.900 --> 00:22:08.030
If we had not sought out a new path,

00:22:08.030 --> 00:22:11.030
we surely would have led ourselves
to our own demise.

00:22:15.070 --> 00:22:19.440
With the death of her older brother,
Miharu lost her soul.

00:22:20.810 --> 00:22:24.650
Big brother...

00:22:28.290 --> 00:22:33.110
Hark

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:39.660
It's time I journey

00:22:43.190 --> 00:22:50.330
Break apart my heart

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:56.860
For crimson sadness

00:22:57.190 --> 00:23:04.370
Pours out from it

00:23:04.580 --> 00:23:08.290
I can only, oh

00:23:08.400 --> 00:23:11.480
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:17.090
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:36.190
I can only, oh

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:39.340
Close my eyes, oh

00:23:39.410 --> 00:23:44.540
I pray, let this break apart

00:23:46.070 --> 00:23:52.520
I beg you, be by my side

00:23:59.480 --> 00:24:01.580
Overwhelmed by the heavy
burden of time,

00:24:01.580 --> 00:24:04.080
Miharu closes herself
off from the world.

00:24:04.080 --> 00:24:06.050
We escape into the city.

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:08.190
Inside the city,

00:24:08.190 --> 00:24:10.520
both yesterday and tomorrow reside
alongside each other.

00:24:11.190 --> 00:24:13.730
We are greeted by resignation
and hope at the same time.

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:16.220
And there is no clear demarcation
between good and evil.

00:24:16.830 --> 00:24:18.360
Asian chaos

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:20.700
Permeates this intersection
where we rest now

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:23.530
Sitting here burdened by our
past and our present being

00:24:24.340 --> 00:24:26.700
This city is like a magnet.
